    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "By 1900 Patagonia had a two‑story depot, and by WWI it featured running water, an opera house, three hotels, a schoolhouse, two parks and several stores.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        9
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
