      ],
      "source": "https://patagonia-az.gov/about/history/"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "The Nature Conservancy bought 312 acres near Sonoita Creek in 1969, creating the Patagonia‑Sonoita Creek Preserve, now a National Natural Landmark.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        11
